sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: RenewChargingStationCertificate<br>The ChargingStationCertificate is renewed using A02/A03
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a<br>Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a Trigger Message Request<br>with requestedMessage SignChargingStationCertificate

    CSMS->>CS: TriggerMessageRequest (requestedMessage = SignChargingStationCertificate)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: requestedMessage must be SignChargingStationCertificate
    CS-->>CSMS: TriggerMessageResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: SignCertificateRequest
    CSMS-->>CS: SignCertificateResponse (status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted

    CSMS->>CS: CertificateSignedRequest (certificateChain = Certificate generated from CSR of step 3, certificateType = ChargingStationCertificate)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: certificateChain must be the certificate generated from the<br>received CSR from step 3 and signed by the configured CSMS Root certificate,<br>certificateType must be ChargingStationCertificate
    CS-->>CSMS: CertificateSignedResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post condition: N/a
